{"product_id":"a-vikram-aditya-story-ranthambore-adventure","title":"A Vikram Aditya Story: Ranthambore Adventure","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis is the story of a tiger.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eOnce a helpless ball of fur, Genghis emerges as a mighty predator, the king of the forest. But the jungle isn't just his kingdom. Soon, Genghis finds himself fighting for his skin against equally powerful predators of a different kind--humans.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe very same ones that Vikram and Aditya get embroiled with when they attempt to lay their hands on a diary that belongs to a ruthless tiger poacher. Worlds collide when one ill-fated encounter plunges the boys and their friend Aarti into a thrilling chase that takes them deep into the magnificent game park of Ranthambore.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:15 x 203  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Deepak Dalal \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780143449379 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43574141223065,"sku":"13RB9780143449379","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/b8427b6c730c1d52a1116c902634575d.jpg?v=1699430459","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/a-vikram-aditya-story-ranthambore-adventure","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}